	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "ngGJ-OH1XdTOvS3Ji",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 11, DX 10, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 11, WILL 11, PER 11, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nE3oWwcgHLdhplv7P",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 17 (offense 13, protection 4), threat tier minor, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "nyDTHQzZAKMF_TMCF",
			"text": "Racial cost: 102 points of traits plus 24 points of skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nICCxKTWVxJk-wdKT",
			"text": "Body weight: 150 lb."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJvwFR0wS7PTGZfV5",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 4 (primary)."
		},
		{
			"id": "neXNbSP8BF2UFPe4z",
			"text": "The enlargement a duergar can call is not on the stat block. It changes size, Strength and reach for a few minutes, and running it is the GM's job."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZI0Bnsi_HBV9xc8h",
			"text": "Mail and a heavy shield are the usual kit and are not in this record's DR."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPhDtK1k2OgUgqans",
			"text": "The encounter figure of eight is the creature. A goblin on its own behaves like a different monster and should be run as one."
		},
		{
